WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.352
Introducing ViDiHand V2.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.729
A hand can look perfectly placed in an image,

3
00:00:07.729 --> 00:00:10.396
and still be wrong in three dimensions.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.480
We wanted to recover where hands really are.

5
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.657
With ViDiHand V2,

6
00:00:19.657 --> 00:00:22.252
we bring 3D to life.

7
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.353
Watch what happens when we move beyond the image.

8
00:00:29.353 --> 00:00:31.288
The depth becomes clear.

9
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.500
Our reconstruction follows the reference through the motion,

10
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.688
with lower three D error.

11
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.081
This is ViDiHand V2,

12
00:00:46.081 --> 00:00:48.308
built for the real world.

13
00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:54.678
The same model works across all four in-the-wild datasets,

14
00:00:54.678 --> 00:00:57.596
capturing hands as everyday life unfolds.

15
00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:17.227
On GenHumanEgo,

16
00:01:17.227 --> 00:01:21.336
just thirty two point six millimeters of error.

17
00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:24.290
We keep hands in sight,

18
00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:27.356
with over ninety nine percent frame accuracy.

19
00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:30.270
The motion stays steady too,

20
00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:33.308
with the lowest jitter in this comparison.

21
00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:46.513
ViDiHand V2.

22
00:01:46.513 --> 00:01:50.044
Let's bring 3D to life.
